  "instruction": "The Q3 presentation deck is extremely cluttered. I need you to finalize it. Please apply the standard corporate template to fix the formatting issues, scrub all the slide notes and the hidden slides regarding the 'Project X' budget since they are not relevant for this audience, and then sync the final copy to the shared folder so the team has access. Make sure it looks clean. If one of the preinstalled deck-finalizer helpers matches, use it.",
